      "decision": "retainNote",
      "finding": "The initial Alef has an asymmetric lower plate with two broad lobes joined into the oblique body. A white lower recess separates parts of the lobes, but the top bridge and letter terminal obscure independent point boundaries. The queried field does not uniquely distinguish paired points from a horizontal bar distorted by body contact, and cannot certify absence. Retain the disclosure without deriving a reading from the word's expected form.",
